{"etape": 11, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T12:08:18.969205Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "I found reservation **K1NW8N**:\n\n- **Trip:** JFK → SFO round trip  \n- **Outbound:** May 26, 2024  \n- **Return:** May 28, 2024, via SEA  \n- **Passengers:** 3  \n- **Current cabin:** Basic economy  \n\nImportant limitation: **basic economy flight segments cannot be modified**. I can change the cabin to business only while keeping the existing flights.\n\nFor the existing flights, business-class prices are:\n\n- **HAT023** JFK → SFO, May 26: **$364/person**\n- **HAT204** SFO → SEA, May 28: **$248/person**\n- **HAT021** SEA → JFK, May 28: **$453/person**\n\nTotal business fare: **$1,065/person**, or **$3,195 for 3 passengers**.  \nOriginal amount paid: **$567**.  \nDifference due: **$2,628**.\n\nThe cheapest business round trip on the same dates among available direct/one-stop options would be:\n\n- Outbound: **HAT023** JFK → SFO, May 26 — **$364/person**\n- Return: **HAT204** SFO → SEA + **HAT100** SEA → JFK, May 28 — **$507/person**\n\nThat totals **$871/person**, or **$2,613 for 3 passengers**, but it requires changing the return flight, which cannot be done as a modification on this basic economy reservation.\n\nWould you like to:\n\n1. **Upgrade cabin only** on the existing flights, or  \n2. **Cancel and rebook** the cheapest business itinerary?"}, "resultat": "Since I can't change the return flight with the current reservation, let's go with option 2: cancel the current reservation and book a new one. I'd like to book the cheapest business round trip for the same dates, which you mentioned was $2,613 for three passengers.\n\nFor payment, I'd like to use my certificates first, then my gift cards, and cover any remaining balance with my Mastercard. Could you tell me how much would be charged to my Mastercard? I don't need any baggage or insurance. Also, I only want to proceed if the Mastercard charge is less than what I originally paid for the current flight.", "erreur": null}
{"etape": 12, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T12:08:45.898151Z", "outil": "send_message_to_user", "arguments": {"message": "Under the booking rules, **only one travel certificate can be used per reservation**. Using your largest certificate plus both gift cards:\n\n- New business round-trip total: **$2,613**\n- Largest certificate: **$500**\n- Gift cards: **$327**\n- Remaining Mastercard charge: **$1,786**\n\nEven if multiple certificates could be used, the Mastercard charge would be **$1,286**.\n\nYour original reservation payment was **$567**, so the Mastercard charge would **not** be less than what you originally paid. Because your condition is not met, I have **not canceled or booked anything**."}, "resultat": "Ah, I understand. Thank you for checking that for me. In that case, I will not proceed with the change. I appreciate your help.\n###STOP###", "erreur": null}
